description=Unlocks full 6GHz (Wi-Fi 6E/7, 59 channels), 6GHz Hotspot / SoftAP (UNII-5), 2.4GHz CH 1-13, 5GHz UNII-1 & UNII-3, and disables SAR power throttling on Pixel 8 / 8 Pro (Tensor G3 / Broadcom BCM4398).
